(doc
  (title "Step 1: Python Project Setup")
  (source-format markdown)
  (converted "2026-07-19")
  (kv "Version" "0.1.0")
  (section
    (heading "Overview")
    (para "Set up the Python project structure with dependencies, configuration files, and basic directory organization. This creates the foundation for building the YX protocol implementation."))
  (section
    (heading "What This Step Builds")
    (para "Creates the Python project foundation: `pyproject.toml` with all dependencies, `src/yx/primitives/` and `src/yx/transport/` package tree, test directories, and a working `pip install -e .[dev]` environment."))
  (section
    (heading "Step Objectives")
    (item "1. Create Python project configuration (pyproject.toml)")
    (item "2. Set up directory structure for source and tests")
    (item "3. Configure dependencies (cryptography library for HMAC/AES)")
    (item "4. Create initial package structure")
    (item "5. Verify Python environment"))
  (section
    (heading "Prerequisites")
    (item "Step 0 completed (BUILD_CONFIG.json exists)")
    (item "Python {{CONFIG:python_version}} or later installed")
    (item "pip package manager available"))
  (section
    (heading "Traceability")
    (kv "Implements" "protocol/specs/architecture/implementation-languages.sxp § Python Considerations")
    (kv "References" "protocol/specs/technical/yx-protocol-spec.sxp (Security requirements)"))
  (section
    (heading "Instructions")
    (subsection
      (heading "Before Starting — Record Start Time")
      (para "Record the current timestamp in ISO 8601 format: `YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ` This is used for duration calculation in the DONE file."))
    (subsection
      (heading "1. Navigate to Build Directory")
      (code "cd builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}"))
    (subsection
      (heading "2. Create pyproject.toml")
      (para "Create `pyproject.toml`:")
      (code "[project]
name = \"yx-protocol\"
version = \"0.1.0\"
description = \"YX UDP Protocol Implementation\"
requires-python = \">={{CONFIG:python_version}}\"
dependencies = [
    \"cryptography>=41.0.0\",
]

[project.optional-dependencies]
dev = [
    \"pytest>=7.4.0\",
    \"pytest-asyncio>=0.21.0\",
    \"pytest-cov>=4.1.0\",
]

[build-system]
requires = [\"setuptools>=68.0.0\", \"wheel\"]
build-backend = \"setuptools.build_meta\"

[tool.pytest.ini_options]
testpaths = [\"tests\"]
python_files = [\"test_*.py\"]
python_classes = [\"Test*\"]
python_functions = [\"test_*\"]
asyncio_mode = \"auto\"

[tool.coverage.run]
source = [\"src\"]
omit = [\"tests/*\"]

[tool.coverage.report]
exclude_lines = [
    \"pragma: no cover\",
    \"def __repr__\",
    \"raise AssertionError\",
    \"raise NotImplementedError\",
]"))
    (subsection
      (heading "3. Create Directory Structure")
      (code "mkdir -p src/yx
mkdir -p src/yx/transport
mkdir -p src/yx/primitives
mkdir -p tests/unit
mkdir -p tests/integration"))
    (subsection
      (heading "4. Create Package __init__.py Files")
      (para "Create `src/yx/__init__.py`:")
      (code "\"\"\"
YX Protocol - Secure UDP-based networking protocol.

Implements: protocol/specs/technical/yx-protocol-spec.sxp
\"\"\"

__version__ = \"0.1.0\"
__all__ = []")
      (para "Create `src/yx/transport/__init__.py`:")
      (code "\"\"\"
YX Transport Layer - UDP packet handling.

Implements: protocol/specs/technical/yx-protocol-spec.sxp § Transport Layer
\"\"\"

__all__ = []")
      (para "Create `src/yx/primitives/__init__.py`:")
      (code "\"\"\"
YX Primitives - Core data structures and utilities.

Implements: protocol/specs/technical/yx-protocol-spec.sxp § Wire Format
\"\"\"

__all__ = []")
      (para "Create `tests/__init__.py`:")
      (code "\"\"\"YX Protocol Tests\"\"\"")
      (para "Create `tests/unit/__init__.py`:")
      (code "\"\"\"YX Unit Tests\"\"\"")
      (para "Create `tests/integration/__init__.py`:")
      (code "\"\"\"YX Integration Tests\"\"\""))
    (subsection
      (heading "5. Install Dependencies")
      (code "pip install -e .[dev]"))
    (subsection
      (heading "6. Create README.sxp")
      (para "Create `README.sxp`:")
      (code "# YX Protocol - Python Implementation

Secure, payload-agnostic UDP-based networking protocol.

## Overview

This is the reference Python implementation of the YX protocol as specified in:
- `../../protocol/specs/technical/yx-protocol-spec.sxp`

## Installation

```bash
pip install -e .[dev]")))
  (section
    (heading "Running Tests")
    (code "pytest"))
  (section
    (heading "Coverage")
    (code "pytest --cov=src --cov-report=html"))
  (section
    (heading "Project Structure")
    (code "src/yx/              # Source code
  transport/         # UDP transport layer
  primitives/        # Core data structures
tests/               # Test suite
  unit/              # Unit tests
  integration/       # Integration tests"))
  (section
    (heading "Specifications")
    (para "Built following YBS (Yelich Build System) methodology.")
    (para "See `../../protocol/specs/` for complete specifications.")
    (code "
### 7. Create .gitignore (in build directory)

Create `.gitignore`:
"))
  (section
    (heading "Python")
    (para "__pycache__/ *.py[cod] *$py.class *.so .Python *.egg-info/ dist/ build/"))
  (section
    (heading "Testing")
    (para ".pytest_cache/ .coverage htmlcov/ .tox/"))
  (section
    (heading "Virtual environments")
    (para "venv/ env/ ENV/"))
  (section
    (heading "IDE")
    (para ".vscode/ .idea/ *.swp *.swo"))
  (section
    (heading "Build artifacts")
    (para "BUILD_STATUS.sxp SESSION.md BUILD_CONFIG.json docs/build-history/")
    (code "
## Verification

**This step is complete when:**

- [ ] `pyproject.toml` exists with correct dependencies
- [ ] Directory structure created (`src/yx/`, `src/yx/transport/`, `src/yx/primitives/`, `tests/unit/`, `tests/integration/`)
- [ ] All `__init__.py` files created
- [ ] Dependencies installed successfully
- [ ] Python environment can import `yx` package
- [ ] pytest can discover the test directory

**Verification Commands:**

```bash
# Verify pyproject.toml exists
test -f pyproject.toml && echo \"✓ pyproject.toml exists\"

# Verify directory structure
test -d src/yx/transport && \\
test -d src/yx/primitives && \\
test -d tests/unit && \\
test -d tests/integration && \\
echo \"✓ Directory structure created\"

# Verify __init__.py files
test -f src/yx/__init__.py && \\
test -f src/yx/transport/__init__.py && \\
test -f src/yx/primitives/__init__.py && \\
echo \"✓ Package files created\"

# Verify package imports
python3 -c \"import yx; print(f'✓ yx package version: {yx.__version__}')\"

# Verify cryptography library
python3 -c \"from cryptography.hazmat.primitives import hashes, hmac; print('✓ cryptography library available')\"

# Verify pytest works
pytest --collect-only && echo \"✓ pytest can discover tests\"")
    (para "**Expected Output:**")
    (code "✓ pyproject.toml exists
✓ Directory structure created
✓ Package files created
✓ yx package version: 0.1.0
✓ cryptography library available
✓ pytest can discover tests")
    (para "**Retry Policy:**")
    (item "Maximum 3 attempts")
    (item "If pip install fails: Check internet connection, retry")
    (item "If directory creation fails: Check permissions, retry")
    (item "If 3 failures: STOP and report error")
    (section
      (heading "Notes")
      (item "This step creates the foundation for all subsequent steps")
      (item "cryptography library provides HMAC-SHA256 and AES-256-GCM")
      (item "pytest-asyncio will be used for async UDP transport tests")
      (item "Directory structure follows Python best practices")
      (item "Each module has __init__.py for proper package imports"))
    (section
      (heading "Documentation")
      (para "**Record end time** and calculate duration (end − start timestamp).")
      (para "Create `docs/build-history/ybs-step_a1b2c3d4e5f6-DONE.txt`:")
      (code "STEP ybs-step_a1b2c3d4e5f6: Python Project Setup
STARTED:    [start timestamp from Before Starting]
COMPLETED:  [ISO 8601 timestamp]
DURATION:   [minutes]

OBJECTIVES COMPLETED:
[copy from Step Objectives above]

FILES CREATED/MODIFIED:
- pyproject.toml
- src/yx/__init__.py
- src/yx/primitives/__init__.py
- src/yx/transport/__init__.py
- tests/__init__.py

VERIFICATION: PASSED (attempt [N])

NEXT STEP: ybs-step_b2c3d4e5f6a1 (GUID Factory)")
      (para "Update `BUILD_STATUS.sxp`: mark this step `[x]` and update **Last Updated** timestamp."))
    (section
      (heading "Success Criteria")
      (para "This step is successful when:")
      (item "1. All verification checks pass (within 3 attempts)")
      (item "2. All required files exist and are valid")
      (item "3. Build compiles/runs without errors")
      (item "4. DONE file created in `docs/build-history/`")
      (item "5. `BUILD_STATUS.sxp` updated"))
    (section
      (heading "Next Steps")
      (para "After completing this step, proceed to:")
      (kv "Next" "`ybs-step_b2c3d4e5f6a1` — GUID Factory"))
    (section
      (heading "Version History")
      (subsection
        (heading "0.1.0 (2026-04-11)")
        (item "Initial step creation")))))
